        Reliability of <span class="search-hit mathjax">Large</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Generated Clinical Reasoning in Assisted Reproductive Technology: Blinded Comparative Evaluation Study
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="search-hit">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+D">Dou Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Long%2C+Y">Ying Long</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zuoqiu%2C+S">Sophia Zuoqiu</a>, 
      
